{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pulls/53","id":4453115510,"node_id":"PR_kwDOSvcS2c8AAAABCW0mdg","html_url":"https://github.com/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pull/53","diff_url":"https://github.com/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pull/53.diff","patch_url":"https://github.com/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pull/53.patch","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/issues/53","commits_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pulls/53/commits","review_comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pulls/53/comments","review_comment_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/pulls/comments{/number}","comments_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/issues/53/comments","statuses_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab/statuses/4f6b469a6cc621af57fd74b4ecf96e291b7439d8","number":53,"state":"closed","locked":false,"title":"DARWIN-MAILBOX-0001: isolated Darwin consumer and verified post-merge activation","user":{"login":"pashamango","id":141678664,"node_id":"U_kgDOCHHYSA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141678664?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango","html_url":"https://github.com/pashamango","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"body":"Darwin currently cannot consume its own mailbox identity. This adds an isolated outbound consumer for `codex@darwin.local` / `Darwin`, with a fixed local repository/author policy, a node-wide cycle lock, and pinned installation after manual merge. Wolfram's installed service is untouched and its entry-point defaults remain unchanged.\n\nStatus: **DARWIN_MAILBOX_AWAITING_MERGE**. No Darwin LaunchAgent is loaded, no activation watermark exists, and no real smoke or old DARWIN-CORE task has run.\n\n## Implementation and review boundaries\n\n- Reuses immutable admission, atomic claim/lease and structured outcome/reporting. Shared changes are limited to an optional storage-root argument and a branch-prefix constant retaining Wolfram defaults.\n- Darwin rejects wrong identities, hosts, authors, repositories, markers, risk/status, body edits and duplicate IDs across current open/closed issues. Fresh source is verified before claim; source changes cannot create replacement admissions.\n- One Codex process per supported Darwin consumer, bounded to 900 seconds (180 for smoke), fixed policy preamble, stdin data, private logs capped at 1 MiB per stream. No model, effort, auth, sandbox or approval overrides.\n- Reporter validates the authoritative claim, lease, digest, logs, strict JSON outcome and trusted PR head repository, `agent/darwin/<task-id>` branch and `main` base. Delivery recovery never re-executes tasks. `EXECUTION_FINISHED` remains distinct from completed/blocked/failed task outcomes.\n- Idempotent install/status/disable; byte-for-byte verified merged files; conflicts fail closed. Activation snapshots existing issue numbers plus a timestamp, then initiates exactly one new read-only smoke. Only a subsequent idempotent poll after valid receipts opens the new-task queue. No updater, merge loop or automatic task retry.\n\n## Validation and local observations\n\n- Checked head: `4f6b469a6cc621af57fd74b4ecf96e291b7439d8`.\n- Based on merged main `65a40e06a340b64b1ce060265a79ce1ba50fcb77`; main was rechecked before publication.\n- `python3 -m unittest discover -s tests -v`: **70 tests passed**, including 25 Darwin tests and all existing Wolfram tests; Python 3.14.6, 17.519 seconds.\n- Tests cover two independent concurrent OS processes with different task IDs, admission rejection, changed source, claim/lease/digest bindings, injection, watermark including same-second creation, timeout/failure without retry, PR constraints, writeback failure, smoke gating and installer pinning/idempotency.\n- `git diff --check` passed. GraphQL `lastEditedAt` availability verified read-only against GitHub.\n- Local `status`: `INACTIVE`, `loaded: false`, installation/activation/last_poll null.\n- CLI: `codex-cli 0.153.4`, `~/.npm-global/bin/codex`; allowlisted config fields show `gpt-6-astra`, `medium`. These are configuration observations, not a claim about a completed future model request.\n- Existing GitHub auth `pashamango`, ADMIN access; no credentials copied or configuration changed. No duplicate bootstrap issue/PR/branch existed.\n\n## Owner handoff\n\nAfter manually merging PR #53, run this exact command on Darwin:\n\n```sh\npython3 ~/ChitAkasha-Darwin/agent-mailbox/source/tools/darwin-mailbox-manage activate --pr 53 --expected-head 4f6b469a6cc621af57fd74b4ecf96e291b7439d8\n```\n\nThe command validates this checked head and merged main, installs only matching reviewed files, creates the old-queue watermark and initiates the bounded smoke through the Darwin LaunchAgent. It returns with smoke pending; `status` reports CONNECTED only after real outcome validation and the subsequent idempotent poll. A failed smoke is never automatically re-executed.\n\nStatus:\n```sh\npython3 ~/ChitAkasha-Darwin/agent-mailbox/source/tools/darwin-mailbox-manage status\n```\n\nDisable only Darwin while retaining history:\n```sh\npython3 ~/ChitAkasha-Darwin/agent-mailbox/source/tools/darwin-mailbox-manage disable\n```\n\nOnly the development checkout under `~/ChitAkasha-Darwin/agent-mailbox/source/` has been created on this machine. Installation adds `releases/<merged-commit>/`, `config/policy.yaml`, private `state/`, and `~/Library/LaunchAgents/com.chitakasha.darwin-agent-mailbox.plist`. Full contract and future-task template: [Darwin runbook](docs/darwin-agent-mailbox.md), [Darwin template](templates/darwin-mailbox-task-v1.md), [shared runbook](CHATGPT-MAILBOX-RUNBOOK.md).\n\nThe user LaunchAgent stops at logout, does not poll during sleep, and starts after reboot only once this user logs into a GUI session. No always-on or phone-push claim is made. Local claims are not distributed locks; never reassign a task ID by editing an issue. The already-installed Wolfram cannot gain historical cross-host enforcement without a separate approved upgrade. New attempts require new IDs and prior-attempt links.\n\nNo live smoke evidence is asserted before manual merge. After activation, require actual reporter receipts `CLAIMED → EXECUTION_FINISHED → TASK_COMPLETED`, a loaded Darwin label and a subsequent idempotent poll. Old DARWIN-CORE tasks remain excluded.\n","labels":[],"milestone":null,"active_lock_reason":null,"created_at":"2026-09-05T21:35:04Z","updated_at":"2026-09-05T21:39:05Z","closed_at":"2026-09-05T21:39:04Z","merged_at":"2026-09-05T21:39:04Z","merge_commit_sha":"c0b9a3cbcda46ceda0a8f40c5c2fd9404c0311c2","assignee":null,"assignees":[],"requested_reviewers":[],"requested_teams":[],"head":{"label":"pashamango:agent/darwin/DARWIN-MAILBOX-0001","ref":"agent/darwin/DARWIN-MAILBOX-0001","repo":{"id":1257706201,"node_id":"R_kgDOSvcS2Q","name":"minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab","full_name":"pashamango/minutta-rp-pr-cycle-lab","owner":{"login":"pashamango","id":141678664,"node_id":"U_kgDOCHHYSA","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/141678664?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/pashamango","html_url":"h